WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.194 --> 00:00:02.862
(upbeat music)

00:00:02.862 --> 00:00:06.779
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:24.860
- [Minnine] OG Ma has been
collecting and reselling

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:27.970
rare, limited edition street
style clothing and accessories

00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:30.070
for over a decade in New York City,

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:32.150
turning what was once a small store

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:33.990
into a six-figure business.

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:37.907
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:47.420
- My name is Minnie Driver.

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:51.140
I am an actress, a singer,
and I am an immigrant.

00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:54.057
I believe nothing is more
American than its immigrants,

00:00:54.057 --> 00:00:56.320
so I'm teaming up with Great Big Story

00:00:56.320 --> 00:01:00.129
to celebrate those that have
come here and left their mark.

00:01:00.129 --> 00:01:02.879
(dramatic music)

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:10.127
(drums beating)

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:14.500
OG Ma, whose real name is Lam
Shi, moved to New York City

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:16.947
and fell in love with
American street style.

00:01:16.947 --> 00:01:20.864
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:56.810 --> 00:01:59.550
Every item Supreme puts
out is limited edition.

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:01.890
A simple box logo tee
from the Supreme store

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:03.780
could run you about $30,

00:02:03.780 --> 00:02:05.660
but once it hits the resale market,

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:07.127
that number could be in the hundreds.

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:10.660
OG Ma was one of the first to
see this as an opportunity,

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:12.173
and Unique Hype was born.

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:15.930
But the way she gets
high-end access from Supreme

00:02:15.930 --> 00:02:18.164
is a secret she won't reveal.

00:02:18.164 --> 00:02:22.081
(speaking in foreign language)

00:02:32.834 --> 00:02:35.996
(orchestral music)

00:02:35.996 --> 00:02:38.110
Once the word about OG Ma's store spread,

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:40.420
that business became a huge success,

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:45.206
and in 2016 it opened up a Hype
2.0 for a special clientele.

00:02:45.206 --> 00:02:49.123
(speaking in foreign language)

00:02:51.678 --> 00:02:53.660
And there's some items
that are so valuable

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:55.791
she wouldnt sell them for any price.

00:02:55.791 --> 00:02:59.708
(speaking in foreign language)

00:03:03.001 --> 00:03:04.940
- It is not for sale, not for sale.

00:03:04.940 --> 00:03:06.519
I don't want the money.

00:03:06.519 --> 00:03:09.436
(orchestral music)

00:03:11.266 --> 00:03:14.160
- [Minnie] OG Ma is an
encyclopedia for street wear,

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:16.573
as she's even attracted
celebrity attention.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:20.463
- Everyday, a lot of people
ask me for the picture.

00:03:22.255 --> 00:03:26.172
(speaking in foreign language)

00:03:33.014 --> 00:03:35.790
- [Minnie] OG Ma is very
proud to have left her mark

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:38.270
on the retail world,
and has even opened up

00:03:38.270 --> 00:03:40.856
a second Unique Hype shop in Hong Kong.

00:03:40.856 --> 00:03:44.773
(speaking in foreign language)

00:04:03.154 --> 00:04:05.737
(upbeat music)

00:04:08.598 --> 00:04:11.181
(bell echoing)

